---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclaimer" description="How Reta makes money.">
  <article class="prose-reta px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl">Affiliate Disclaimer</h1>

    <p>Reta is a free publication. We pay for hosting and writers by participating in affiliate programs, including the Adsterra CPA network and direct partnerships with dating platforms.</p>

    <h2>What this means</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>When you click a sponsored card or in-article link and sign up for a service, we may earn a commission.</li>
      <li>This <strong>does not change the price you pay</strong>. Most services we feature offer a free signup tier.</li>
      <li>We mark sponsored sections clearly with "Sponsored," "Recommended," or a small disclosure note.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
    <p>Our writers select platforms based on what we think the audience will find useful. We turn down offers we cannot recommend in good conscience, even when payouts are high.</p>

    <h2>No personal advice</h2>
    <p>We write to a general audience. Nothing on this site is personal dating, relationship, medical, legal, or financial advice.</p>

    <h2>Reporting an issue</h2>
    <p>If you had a bad experience with a service we link to, please <a href="/contact/">tell us</a>. We take complaints seriously and pull bad partners.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
